1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[whooshing]

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
[narrator] The recently revived King,

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
now calling himself Meruem,

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
headed back to the palace

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
to recover his memories
with Pouf and Youpi in tow.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
[whooshing]

7
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
[singer singing in English]

8
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

9
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,000
[Komugi] I wish someone would tell me
what's happening.

10
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,000
The sight of it annoys me.

11
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,000
It's the enemy's power, sire.

12
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,000
I think the only way
that we can get it to disappear

13
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
is to hurt the enemy himself.

14
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Ah. Interesting.

15
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Then let's find out.

16
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,000
[gasps]

17
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Incredible.

18
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Is that really my…

19
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,000
[explosion]

20
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,000
[gasps]

21
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,000
[gasps]

22
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,000
[Meruem] I see.

23
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] I was wrong.

24
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:43,000
My power was never meant
for me to use.

25
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,000
This doesn't make any sense.

26
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,000
-[Menthuthuyoupi] Huh?
-[gasps]

27
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:03,000
and for you to know that,
you either saw it used,

28
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:07,000
or it was used on you personally.

29
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,000
So which is it?

30
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:13,000
[tense music playing]

31
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:31,000
So why does the enemy still draw breath?

32
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
[grunts]

33
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:38,000
I want you to tell me
how you deactivated the enemy's ability.

34
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,000
Well?

35
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,000
[sighs]

36
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,000
In exchange for releasing me
from his power,

37
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,000
I agreed to spare his comrade.

38
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,000
[Meruem] Then, after he released you,

39
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,000
[gasps]

40
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,000
Now, Pouf.

41
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Sire.

42
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,000
-[Meruem] Youpi.
-Sire!

43
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Our relationships
have become quite complex.

44
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
[both gasp]

45
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,000
It seems that our bodies and souls

46
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:19,000
have become intertwined,
and, as a result of this fact,

47
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
there can be no more secrets
between us.

48
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Let's go.

49
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,000
[both] Right.

50
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:40,000
[Shaiapouf]
Sire, have you somehow realized

51
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,000
what it is I plan to do?

52
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Was that meant as some sort
of final warning?

53
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:48,000
Do you sense how my guilt
tears away at me?

54
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,000
I do this for the King!

55
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,000
[segments muttering]

56
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,000
-Find her.
-Find her quickly.

57
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,000
-Hurry up. Find her.
-Hurry up, and find her.

58
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,000
[Shaiapouf] For the sake
of our species…

59
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,000
[segment] Find her.

60
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,000
[Shaiapouf] I do this for the King.

61
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:19,000
-[segment] There? No.
-Is she over there?

62
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,000
[chatter continues]

63
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Where are you going?
I'm talking to you!

64
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,000
You can't remove A.P.R.
till you beat me!

65
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,000
No, that's somebody else.

66
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:52,000
There's one who can make himself
and everyone around him invisible.

67
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,000
He looks just like a chameleon.

68
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:58,000
I don't know his name,
but he's a Squadron Leader,

69
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:25,000
[both gasp]

70
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Youpi, your own emotional instability,

71
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:33,000
as well as the traitor's betrayal,

72
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,000
Humans are a steppingstone

73
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:42,000
meant to help us attain
the next level of evolution,

74
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,000
the perfect sacrifice.

75
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:50,000
The remnants of human ego
within us are variables,

76
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
as long as we consider them

77
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,000
following the explosion.

78
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:05,000
Was this a result of the blast?

79
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:23,000
that can still see
and then expand the search.

80
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,000
[Knuckle] Bastard.

81
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:33,000
I'm not his target. That much is obvious.

82
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,000
He turned back just like that.

83
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,000
Who is he after?

84
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,000
but I don't see how we can
without Meleoron's ability.

85
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:56,000
I've got to protect Meleoron,
no matter the cost.

86
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,000
that they're too small for me to see.

87
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Unlike his main body,

88
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:10,000
his segments have to be at full size
for me to see them.

89
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:19,000
[Shaiapouf] The man with the pompadour
was obviously just a decoy.

90
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,000
They must know that we've made
sense of it by now

91
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:25,000
and we know the chameleon is a traitor.

92
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:29,000
In other words, they believe
that's why I've returned,

93
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:31,000
to dispose of the double-crosser.

94
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,000
Assuming that the chameleon

95
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:37,000
is concealing himself
and the others as they flee

96
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,000
and assuming
that the woman is among them,

97
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,000
They believe the chameleon is my target.

98
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:52,000
If only they knew how wrong they are.

99
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:55,000
They'd never imagine
that I would return to kill the woman

100
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:58,000
Pitou was trying so desperately to heal.

101
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,000
And if I'm lucky, they may even offer
to hand her over to me,

102
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,000
with conditions, of course.

103
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:16,000
[tense music playing]

104
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:20,000
[Knuckle] That little monster's
after Meleoron. He must be.

105
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,000
It would make perfect sense,

106
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:25,000
because, to them, he's nothing
more than a traitor.

107
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Hold on.

108
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:31,000
We need to be sure about it.

109
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,000
[beeps]

110
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,000
[Shaiapouf] The door leading underground?

111
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,000
So that's it.

112
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,000
They've realized I know
they can become invisible,

113
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:07,000
or he fled somewhere else entirely.

114
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,000
That's their plan.
They intend to weaken me

115
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,000
by splitting up my segments even further.

116
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,000
-[segments chattering]
-[segment] No. Over there.

117
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,000
-Over there.
-Over there.

118
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,000
-There.
-Over there.

119
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,000
-Over there.
-Over there.

120
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:21,000
[gasps]

121
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:23,000
[tense music playing]

122
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,000
[Shaiapouf] What?

123
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:51,000
So they want to determine
what my target is. Is that it?

124
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,000
What should I do?

125
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:58,000
Do I split up my segments
to hide my objective,

126
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,000
No. There's no time.

127
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,000
I've made my decision.

128
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,000
I'll go after the girl!

129
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:24,000
[Killua] So she's his target?

130
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:26,000
[Shaiapouf] I only have to kill the woman

131
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
and hide her body
from the King for a short time.

132
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,000
My segment can manage that.

133
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:33,000
I only need a minute!

134
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:44,000
-[electricity crackles]
-[gasps]

135
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:58,000
Well, I'm up for a game of tag,

136
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,000
and I can play all night long.

137
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[gasps]

138
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,000
[Shaiapouf] Judging by how quickly
he reacted,

139
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:08,000
it would be nearly impossible
for me to catch him,

140
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,000
even at full strength.

141
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:13,000
If I don't hurry, the King will arrive.

142
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,000
What do I do?

143
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,000
[narrator] Pressured by the crisis
he faced,

144
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,000
Pouf came up with an evil plan.

145
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,000
[Shaiapouf] That's it.

146
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:25,000
I know the perfect magic trick.

147
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,000
[Killua gasps]

148
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:35,000
What's his plan?

149
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,000
Is he gonna attack me first?

150
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,000
That's gonna backfire.

151
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,000
You've reduced your speed and power,

152
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:52,000
All of your so carefully laid plans
have already been foiled.

153
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,000
[gasps]

154
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,000
you needn't worry.

155
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
The King will forgive you.

156
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:32,000
I don't know why, but for some reason,

157
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,000
this girl is extremely
important to the King,

158
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:38,000
So for Gon and for the sake
of our mission,

159
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,000
I can't let the enemy have her.

160
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:48,000
who was talking with dear leader before.

161
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:52,000
Does that mean the King is dear leader?

162
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
Then who is this,

163
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,000
and who are all the people he was with?

164
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:01,000
Your twisted sense of justice
is pointless.

165
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,000
You know it will never benefit the people.

166
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,000
Just let me go! You feel weird!

167
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,000
What the hell are you doing?

168
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,000
You're all staticky, and I don't like it!

169
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,000
[Killua] Oh, you think so, huh?

170
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,000
You trust that insect
more than you trust me?

171
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:48,000
[Komugi] "Insect"? What insect?
What are you talking about?

172
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,000
[Killua groans] I forgot.

173
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:51,000
-She can't see.
-[Komugi] Let go! Please!

174
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,000
[tense music playing]

175
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,000
[Shaiapouf] Damn it. Almost.

176
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,000
[laughs]

177
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:06,000
It didn't take long
for the poison to kick in.

178
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
If the woman you're carrying
chooses to resist,

179
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:12,000
your speed is bound to suffer.

180
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:15,000
[tense music playing]

181
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,000
[Killua] What's going on?

182
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,000
He wasn't aiming for me,

183
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:21,000
which has to mean
he was aiming for the woman.

184
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,000
He wanted to kill her.

185
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:36,000
allowing me to kill her,
that's all the better.

186
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,000
Oh, Miss Komugi!

187
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:48,000
Keep fighting back against your captors!

188
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:51,000
I will save you soon!

189
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,000
[gasps]

190
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:54,000
[tense music playing]

191
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,000
[gasps]

192
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:01,000
[Killua] She's knocked out.

193
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:05,000
All right, I won't pretend
to know what your deal is,

194
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,000
but what I do know

195
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:09,000
is that you're really starting
to piss me off.

196
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:12,000
[electricity crackling]

197
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:32,000
[upbeat music playing]

198
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,000
[Killua] It's true you might be a segment,

199
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,000
but you were still formed
from the original's cells, weren't you?

200
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:44,000
I only have to burn them, and they'll die.

201
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:47,000
Electricity.

202
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,000
I shall lend you a hand.

203
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:05,000
There's no need to concern yourself.

204
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:09,000
Your priority should be
regaining your memory, Lord Meruem.

205
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:14,000
I'll take them just as soon
as my body has returned.

206
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:20,000
Lord Meruem, feast your eyes
on the scene before you.

207
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:22,000
[tense music playing]

208
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:27,000
Does this refresh your memory?

209
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:29,000
They are here for you.

210
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,000
Each one of them belongs to you!

211
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:35,000
They belong to me?

212
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:39,000
You will rule
over these ignorant, inferior creatures

213
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:42,000
and stand proudly atop the food chain!

214
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:46,000
The entire world will shine
beneath your glorious light.

215
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,000
This is your divine destiny!

216
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:03,000
[Meruem] Something isn't right.

217
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,000
Huh?

218
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Something…

219
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:10,000
is missing, something important.

220
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,000
Something that isn't this.

221
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:15,000
[gasps]

222
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:17,000
[Shaiapouf] What are you saying, sire?
You must be mistaken.

223
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:21,000
Nothing could be more important
than ruling over all life forms.

224
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,000
Maybe you're right.

225
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,000
It was destroyed during the battle.

226
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:50,000
It broke out not very long
after you had left the palace, sire.

227
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,000
This is bad.

228
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,000
That could be it,

229
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:20,000
the Gungi board and pieces.

230
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,000
[Killua gasps]

231
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:26,000
[Shaiapouf] If he sees them,
they'll trigger his memory.

232
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:36,000
[Killua] He just gave up?

233
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:54,000
[Gon] Over there.

234
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,000
Let's go.

235
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:43,000
[Gon] Yeah, but still, thanks.

236
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
